# Purchased Petixel art packs (art-src/petixel/) and pictures made from them
# (art-src/made/): keep them on your own computer only. The licence doesn't
# allow publishing them, and this repository is public. The game's images
# (assets/) are built from them by the map maker and tools/build_assets.py.
# The game's own drawings (art-src/own/) are shared.
art-src/*
!art-src/own/

# Builds
dist/
_site/
__pycache__/

